      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我平常不会像这样拼命到处跑，\n替派对挑选的衣服也汗水淋漓地黏在身上。\n……但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1beb03ea31dfd95f75748b03f101e5abf3659c1dfdbd6dcb900d38573ebe0c7d",
